    <briefdescription>
<para>Doubly-linked-list node of a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomial_table" kindref="compound">MonomialTable</ref></computeroutput>&apos;s per-component monomial list. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="struct_monomial_table_1_1mon__term_a669c593436853fb20e1b719ad6c3a767_1a669c593436853fb20e1b719ad6c3a767" kindref="member">_lead</ref></computeroutput> points to the entry&apos;s exponent vector (owned by the caller, not by the table), <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_monomial_table_1_1mon__term_aec1d7f00b9b152f3ccc290221571020d_1aec1d7f00b9b152f3ccc290221571020d" kindref="member">_mask</ref></computeroutput> is the precomputed divisibility bitmask used to skip non-divisors during search, and <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_monomial_table_1_1mon__term_a177c606e116e63b6bdc90b4aad925b66_1a177c606e116e63b6bdc90b4aad925b66" kindref="member">_val</ref></computeroutput> is the caller-supplied opaque index returned on a hit. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
